  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interamerican special rapporteur for freedom of expression, 2023 - 2024 - Interamerican special rapporteur for freedom of expression</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Interamerikanska specialrapport&#xf6;ren f&#xf6;r yttrandefrihet, 2023 - 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att garantera r&#xe4;tten till yttrandefrihet som ett s&#xe4;tt att st&#xe4;rka och uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla demokratiska institutioner och r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer i Latinamerika. Detta kommer att g&#xf6;ras genom att arbeta mot f&#xf6;ljande tre m&#xe5;l:

1. Att fr&#xe4;mja grundl&#xe4;ggande friheter vilka &#xe4;r essentiella f&#xf6;r demokratiska samh&#xe4;llen.

2. Att verka f&#xf6;r journalisters s&#xe4;kerhet och respekt f&#xf6;r mediefrihet och m&#xe5;ngfald.

3. Att fr&#xe4;mja skyddet av digitala r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r ut&#xf6;vandet av yttrandefrihet online.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims at guaranteeing the right to freedom of expression for the strengthening and preservation of democratic institutions and the rule of law in Latin America, this will be done by working towards the following three objectives: 

1. To promote fundamental freedoms essential to democracy.

2. To promote the safety of journalists and a plural and diverse media.

3. To advance the protection of digital rights for the exercise of freedom of expression online.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims at guaranteeing the right to freedom of expression for the strengthening and preservation of democratic institutions and the rule of law in Latin America, this will be done by working towards the following three objectives: 

1. To promote fundamental freedoms essential to democracy.

2. To promote the safety of journalists and a plural and diverse media.

3. To advance the protection of digital rights for the exercise of freedom of expression online.</narrative>
  </description>
